# Title: Mstsc.EXE Execution With Local RDP File
# ID: 5fdce3ac-e7f9-4ecd-a3aa-a4d78ebbf0af
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), Christopher Peacock @securepeacock
# Date: 2023-04-18
# Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1219.002
# Description: Detects potential RDP connection via Mstsc using a local ".rdp" file
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process.command_line:*.rdp OR process.command_line:*.rdp\")) AND ((process.executable:*\\mstsc.exe) OR (process.pe.original_file_name:"mstsc.exe"))) AND NOT ((process.parent.executable:"C:\\Windows\\System32\\lxss\\wslhost.exe" AND process.command_line:*C:\\ProgramData\\Microsoft\\WSL\\wslg.rdp*)))
